# The backend runs on Render, not here — Vercel only serves the static
# studio. Without this, every file under server/ is fetchable on the live
# domain (server/src/**, package.json, .env.example were all returning 200).
# No credentials live in those files, but there is no reason to publish
# them either. firebase.json's hosting.ignore does the same for the
# Firebase mirror; keep the two in step.
server/

# Local scaffolding that is not part of the site.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
